        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the omission of the `ida_simple_remove()` function call in the error handling path of the `ring_request_msix()` function. When an error occurred during the IRQ vector retrieval or the IRQ request, the allocated IDA entry was not being removed, leading to potential resource leaks and inconsistent state management.

        Commit message:
        thunderbolt: Add the missed ida_simple_remove() in
